# Generated register dumps and resaved test artifacts (make verify)
tests/dumps/

# Locally built binaries
tools/bin/
tools/gt2-refdump/gt2dump
gt2-src/**/*.o
gt2-src/goattrk2

# Generated driver binary (rebuild with `make driver`)
exporters/gt2/build/gt2_driver.prg
.DS_Store
hvsc-cache/

# Third-party SID tunes are their composers' copyrighted work - never commit
# them. Tunes are fetched from HVSC on demand via the /hvsc/ proxy
# (tools/serve.py) into hvsc-cache/ above. Songs authored HERE live as .sng
# (sids/default-song.sng), which is deliberately still tracked.
sids/*.sid

# The C64 Pro Mono webfont is Style's work, and their license draws a line
# exactly here: embedding it via @font-face for display on a web site is
# allowed, but redistributing the files "in any font collection" - which a
# public repo is - is not. So style.css references fonts/ and every
# font-family falls back to plain monospace when it is absent. Fetch it
# yourself from https://style64.org/c64-truetype (C64 TrueType v1.2.1/Style)
# and drop the .woff/.woff2 in here, unmodified and under their own filenames.
fonts/

# Pages build output (tools/build-pages.mjs)
_site/
